    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. can you maybe break down a weekly schedule for me? like which days i should lift and what an actual workout session should look like so i dont get overwhelmed. also i am worried about getting super sore or feeling really drained after the first week, is that normal?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I suggest a 3-day full-body split to allow adequate recovery. For example, lift on Monday, Wednesday, and Friday, with rest days in between. A typical session could involve warm-ups followed by your main lifts (Squat, Bench, Deadlift) and finishing with some light accessory work like rows or overhead press. Yes, some soreness is normal when starting, but if the fatigue is debilitating, reduce your working weight slightly for the next session.",
      "source": "target",
